{%- comment -%} How to take, from components/sections/HowToTakeContent on ip6original.com. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  #htt-{{ section.id }} { font-family: var(--sans); color: var(--ip6-navy); }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .narrow { width: min(768px, calc(100% - 2 * var(--gutter))); margin-inline: auto; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .mid { width: min(1024px, calc(100% - 2 * var(--gutter))); margin-inline: auto; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .hero { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ip6-cloud-300); }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .hero .narrow { padding: 80px 0; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .ip6-eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.025em; font-weight: 400; text-wrap: balance; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .lead { margin-top: 24px; max-width: 42rem; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #001840b3; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .primer { padding-top: 56px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .primer .ip6-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .primer p.txt { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #001840bf; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards { padding: 64px 0; display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards li { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--ip6-cloud-300); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--ip6-gold-700); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #001840cc; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .band { border-top: 1px solid var(--ip6-cloud-300); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ip6-cloud-300); }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .block { padding: 64px 0; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .block .ip6-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .stack p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #001840d9; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .stack p + p { margin-top: 16px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .stack strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ip6-navy); }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .italic { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; color: #001840a6; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .close { border-top: 1px solid var(--ip6-cloud-300); text-align: center; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .close .ready { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .close .rule { display: inline-block; height: 1px; width: 48px; background: var(--ip6-gold); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .close .ip6-btn { padding: 16px 32px; }
  #htt-{{ section.id }} .close .ip6-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { #htt-{{ section.id }} .hero .narrow { padding: 96px 0; } #htt-{{ section.id }} .primer { padding-top: 64px; } #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards { padding: 80px 0; } #htt-{{ section.id }} .cards li { padding: 28px; } #htt-{{ section.id }} .block { padding: 80px 0; } #htt-{{ section.id }} .stack p, #htt-{{ section.id }} .primer p.txt { font-size: 20px; } }
</style>
<article id="htt-{{ section.id }}" class="ip6">
  <section class="hero"><div class="narrow">
    <p class="ip6-eyebrow">How to Take</p>
    <h1>Take it. Here is exactly how.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Take 4 capsules once or twice daily with water, or as directed by your healthcare professional. Always consult your physician before beginning any supplement regimen.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="primer"><div class="narrow">
    <p class="ip6-eyebrow">How IP6 and Inositol work together</p>
    <p class="txt">IP6 is <strong>inositol</strong> carrying six phosphate groups; <strong>Inositol</strong> is the same core molecule without them. IP6 Original combines Calcium-Magnesium IP6 with Inositol, the pairing Professor Shamsuddin&rsquo;s research is built around.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="mid"><ol class="cards">
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg><h3>Once or twice daily</h3><p>Take 4 capsules once or twice daily, or as directed by your healthcare professional.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 2v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2"/><path d="M7 2v20"/><path d="M21 15V2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v6c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3Zm0 0v7"/></svg><h3>With water only</h3><p>Take each serving with water.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg><h3>Consult your physician</h3><p>Always discuss new supplements with your healthcare professional before beginning.</p></li>
  </ol></section>
  <section class="band"><div class="narrow block">
    <p class="ip6-eyebrow">Dosing protocol</p>
    <h2>Daily dose, pairing, timing.</h2>
    <div class="stack">
      <p><strong>Serving size is 4 capsules.</strong> Take 4 capsules once or twice daily with water, or as directed by a healthcare professional. The 240-capsule bottle holds 60 servings.</p>
      <p>Take it at the same time each day so the routine is easy to keep.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="narrow block">
    <p class="ip6-eyebrow">When not to take it</p>
    <h2>Cautions and contraindications.</h2>
    <div class="stack">
      <p>If you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or managing a health condition, consult your healthcare provider before use.</p>
      <p>Stop taking IP6 Original and contact your physician if you experience any adverse reaction.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="italic">Always consult your physician before beginning any supplement regimen, including IP6 Original.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="close"><div class="narrow block">
    <p class="ready">Ready when you are.</p>
    <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/shop#people" class="ip6-btn">Shop IP6 Original <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div>
  </div></section>
</article>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "IP6 How to take", "tag": "section", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "IP6 How to take" }] }
{% endschema %}
